    "perplexity": {
      "description": "Eras III is a 2018 Devin Townsend box set that gathers key material from his mid-2000s-to-2010s catalog into a single 10-LP collection. Issued in a limited deluxe edition, it presents a curated overview of the heavier, more expansive side of Townsend’s work and is part of a broader series of archival vinyl sets celebrating different periods of his career.\n\nThe set includes Accelerated Evolution, Epicloud, Transcendence, Sky Blue, and Live At The Royal Albert Hall, all pressed on 180-gram vinyl and housed in a sturdy box with a booklet of lyrics, liner notes, and Townsend’s comments. Released through Inside Out Music and Sony Music, it was aimed at collectors and fans who wanted these albums in a premium vinyl format, with some titles newly mastered for vinyl to improve sound quality.",
